# 1099Pass — Cursor Build Spec

> Data intelligence platform translating gig/1099 income into lender-ready reports.

**Entity:** SLTR Digital LLC | **Founder:** Kevin Minn | **Domain:** 1099pass.com

---

## READ THIS FIRST

1099Pass is **NOT** a tax filing product. It is **NOT** a lender or broker. It is a **data intelligence and facilitation platform** that aggregates, normalizes, and translates gig worker / 1099 contractor income data into clean, standardized, lender-ready reports that dramatically increase the likelihood of loan approval.

**The core product is the Income Verification Report. Everything else exists to support it.**

