## Database (PostgreSQL 15 — 11 tables)

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `borrowers` | User profiles, KYC status, subscription tier, Cognito sub |
| `financial_profiles` | Income data, readiness score, income trend, DTI, sources (JSONB) |
| `documents` | Uploaded tax returns, 1099s, bank statements, P&L |
| `reports` | Generated income verification reports (type, status, data snapshot, S3 keys, share tokens) |
| `lenders` | Institution info, plan tier, verification status, Cognito sub |
| `lending_criteria` | Lender preferences: loan types, income range, gig platforms, geography, DTI/credit thresholds |
| `matches` | Borrower-lender matches with score, status flow (PENDING→VIEWED→INTERESTED→CONTACTED→DECLINED) |
| `messages` | Encrypted in-app messaging between borrowers and lenders |
| `subscriptions` | Billing state for both borrowers (IAP) and lenders (Square) |
| `notifications` | Push notification records |
| `audit_logs` | Full audit trail for compliance |

**DynamoDB tables:** sessions, ws-connections (WebSocket), notifications (with TTL)

