## Core Services (The IP)

### Income Normalization Engine (`income-normalization-service.ts`)
- Pulls 24 months of Plaid transactions
- Identifies income by gig platform (18 platforms: Uber, DoorDash, Upwork, Etsy, etc.)
- Builds monthly history with anomaly detection (>2 std dev)
- Calculates stability metrics: CoV, weighted average, YoY growth, diversity (HHI), seasonality
- Produces 4 annualized projections: trailing average, weighted moving, seasonal adjusted, trend adjusted
- Detects recurring obligations for DTI analysis
- All monetary values in **cents** (integer arithmetic, no floating point)

### Loan Readiness Score (`loan-score-service.ts`)
0-100 proprietary score with letter grades (A+ through F):

| Component | Weight | What It Measures |
|-----------|--------|-----------------|
| Income Stability | 25% | Month-to-month consistency (CV-based) |
| Income Trend | 20% | YoY growth direction |
| Income Diversity | 15% | Number of active income sources |
| Documentation | 15% | Tax returns, 1099s, bank statements uploaded |
| Income Level | 15% | Annual income tier + DTI adjustment |
| Account Age | 10% | Months of verified history |

Loan type thresholds: Mortgage (75/60), Auto (55/40), Personal (50/35), Business (65/50), HELOC (70/55)
Generates top 5 actionable recommendations with potential score increase + timeframe.

### Report Generator (`report-generator-service.ts`)
Produces lender-ready PDF + JSON reports with 10 sections:
1. Header (ID, date, 90-day expiry, verification badge)
2. Borrower Summary (name, location, account age, verification)
3. Income Overview (projected annual, confidence intervals, trajectory)
4. Income Source Breakdown (per-platform, up to 6)
5. 24-Month History Chart
6. Stability Metrics
7. Loan Readiness Score + component breakdown
8. DTI Estimate
9. Document Verification Status
10. Legal Disclaimer (FCRA + facilitation model)

Reports stored in S3 with KMS encryption. Shared via secure tokens (30-day expiry). Presigned PDF URLs (1-hour expiry).

### Plaid Service (`plaid-service.ts`)
- Products: Transactions (24mo), Auth, Identity, Balance
- Access tokens encrypted with KMS before DB storage
- 16 gig platforms auto-identified from merchant names
- Mock mode for development with realistic data generation
- Exponential backoff retry (1s base, 3 attempts)
- **Production keys are LIVE** (migrated 2026-02-23)

