### AI Safety Rules

- **NEVER send Plaid access tokens** to Bedrock — decrypt only for Plaid API calls
- **NEVER send full SSN/TIN/account numbers** — redact before any AI prompt
- **NEVER let AI make lending decisions** — it ranks and explains, humans decide
- **AI chat responses include disclaimer:** "I'm an AI assistant, not a financial advisor"
- **Log all AI calls in audit_logs** (prompt hash + model used, NOT prompt content if it contains financial data)
- **Rate limit chat:** 30 messages/day per borrower
- **Document analysis requires user confirmation** before data enters financial profile

