## Dev Commands

```bash
# Lender Portal (browser)
cd ~/Desktop/1099Pass/1099Pass/apps/lender-portal && npm run dev
# → http://localhost:3000

# Borrower App (phone/simulator)
cd ~/Desktop/1099Pass/1099Pass/apps/borrower-app && npx expo start
# Press 'i' for iOS simulator

# Type Check
cd ~/Desktop/1099Pass/1099Pass && npx tsc --noEmit

# Deploy
cd ~/Desktop/1099Pass/1099Pass && ./scripts/deploy.sh dev

# Redeploy Lender Portal (live site — S3 + CloudFront)
# Must use static export; one-command script:
cd ~/Desktop/1099Pass/1099Pass && ./scripts/deploy-lender-portal.sh
# Or manually: BUILD_FOR_S3=true npm run build --workspace=@1099pass/lender-portal
# then: aws s3 sync apps/lender-portal/out s3://pass1099-prod-lender-portal --delete
# then: aws cloudfront create-invalidation --distribution-id E2L2IO6SQNRKCZ --paths "/*"
# See docs/DEPLOY-LENDER-PORTAL.md
```

