## Non-Negotiable Rules

- TypeScript strict mode everywhere
- All SQL uses parameterized queries
- All Plaid tokens encrypted with KMS before storage
- PII never in logs, error messages, or analytics
- NEVER add Square to the borrower React Native app (IAP only)
- NEVER send raw Plaid data to lenders (only processed reports)
- NEVER store bank login credentials
- Run `npx tsc --noEmit` after every change
- All monetary values in **cents** (integer arithmetic)
- Row-level security on all PostgreSQL tables
- Zod validation on every input boundary

